  "Id": 3402,
  "Title": "CIME Partners with HOPES and SPIE to Conduct an IV and Catheterization Simulation Workshop",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "The IV and Catheterization Workshop at KMDC, a collaboration between CIME, SPIE, and HOPES, enhanced practical skills for 60 learners, highlighting the value of hands-on medical education.",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "CIME, SPIE, and HOPES collaborated to conduct an IV and Catheterization Simulation Workshop at the HOPES SKILLS EXPO on February 17, 2024, at Karachi Medical and Dental College (KMDC)."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The workshop attracted 60 learners from various institutions. Led by experienced nurses, interactive simulation exercises kicked off the workshop, providing hands-on learning opportunities. Following the simulation sessions, a comprehensive debriefing covered essential topics including indications, contraindications, proper placement, and sterility maintenance for IV and catheterization procedures. "
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Collaborations like this will advance medical education and foster a culture of excellence and continuous learning among aspiring healthcare professionals. Through such initiatives, we aim to equip students with essential skills and knowledge, ensuring they are ready to deliver high-quality patient care in the future."
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
